<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Jönsson et al. (2006) & Smith et al. (2006) up-the-gradient PIN1 polarization and polar auxin transport model for shoot apical meristem phyllotaxis — Code-to-model traceability: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Module and function docstrings map every equation to Jönsson et al. (2006) PNAS Eqs. 1-4 & Figs. 2-4, Smith et al. (2006) PNAS Eqs. 1-3 & Figs. 3-5, Reinhardt et al. (2003) Nature Figs. 1-2, and the 3 formal Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_032_auxin_pin1_phyllotaxis.lean` (L1-36, L102-230)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
