    pk:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Jönsson et al. (2006) & Smith et al. (2006) up-the-gradient PIN1 polarization and polar auxin transport model for shoot apical meristem phyllotaxis — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements Boltzmann up-the-gradient PIN1 membrane allocation and linearized Turing-like dispersion eigenvalues (`evaluate_up_gradient_dispersion_and_allocation`, L102-182), a 180-cell 2D L1 shoot apical meristem coupled Auxin-PIN1 ODE integrator (`simulate_2d_sam_auxin_pin1_phyllotaxis`, L188-348), 4-regime phyllotactic mode transitions across Gamma = R_PZ / lambda_0 (`simulate_four_phyllotactic_modes`, L354-441), and NPA/pin1 block + exogenous IAA microdroplet rescue (`simulate_npa_and_iaa_rescue_experiments`, L447-531), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_032_auxin_pin1_phyllotaxis.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Jönsson et al. (2006) & Smith et al. (2006) up-the-gradient PIN1 polarization and polar auxin transport model for shoot apical meristem phyllotaxis — Morphometric validation: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L748-825) computes 9 reference-anchored morphometric measurements with uncertainty, p-values, and negative controls, all 9 within 3.2% of reference benchmarks: spiral divergence angle 137.39 ± 1.24 deg (ref 137.51), characteristic spacing wavelength 5.196 cells (ref 5.2), critical PIN1 feedback threshold c_1*a_0 = 1.7500 (ref 1.75), PIN1 convergence polarity index 0.8527 (ref 0.84), 4-mode divergence angle Pearson r = 1.0000 (p = 2.23e-5, RMSE = 0.24 deg), NPA polar transport block contrast 1.0000 (ref 1.0, 0 primordia), exogenous IAA paste rescue peak angle 60.00 deg (ref 60.0 deg, 0.00 deg error), rosette azimuthal sector coverage 1.0000 (ref 1.0), and leaf spacing regularity 1 - CV = 0.7737 (ref 0.75)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-measurement-characteristic-primordium-spacing-wavelength>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-measurement-critical-pin1-feedback-threshold-c1-a0>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-measurement-exogenous-iaa-paste-rescue-peak-angle>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-measurement-four-mode-divergence-angle-pearson-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-measurement-npa-polar-transport-block-contrast>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-measurement-pin1-primordium-convergence-polarity-index>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-measurement-specimen-rosette-azimuthal-sector-coverage>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-measurement-specimen-rosette-leaf-spacing-regularity-1-minus-cv>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-measurement-spiral-phyllotaxis-divergence-angle-mean>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-morphometric-validation-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Jönsson et al. (2006) & Smith et al. (2006) up-the-gradient PIN1 polarization and polar auxin transport model for shoot apical meristem phyllotaxis — MorphoEval overall 92.6/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2006-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem.py` (overall weighted score: 92.8/100, up from 53.8/100 in v1). The remediated script implements the linearized Turing-like up-the-gradient dispersion relation and Boltzmann PIN1 allocation law (critical threshold c_1*a_0 = 1.75, characteristic spacing lambda_c = 5.196 cells / 36.37 um); integrates a 180-cell 2D SAM L1 Auxin-PIN1 ODE model reproducing golden-angle phyllotaxis (137.39 ± 1.24 deg vs ref 137.51 deg) and PIN1 convergence polarity index 0.8527 (ref 0.84); reproduces transitions across all 4 phyllotactic regimes (Spiral 137.5 deg, Distichous 179.5 deg, Decussate 89.9 deg, Tricussate 120.1 deg; Pearson r = 1.0000, p = 2.23e-5); validates Reinhardt et al. (2003) NPA/pin1-1 polar transport block (contrast 1.0000, 0 primordia) and localized IAA lanolin paste rescue at 60.0 deg (1 primordium, 0.00 deg error); and segments 410 spiral rosette leaves on the SHA-256-locked Aeonium tabuliforme specimen (`rosette_phyllotaxis_specimen.jpg`, NN packing regularity 1 - CV = 0.7737 vs ref 0.75). Overall 92.6/100 (faithfulness 92.3, reproducibility 93.4); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0cb0132; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 91, Parameter expressivity 91, Morphometric validation 93, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 93. Output judged: docs/media/auxin_pin1_phyllotaxis_comparison.png: rendered output of 2006-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem.py at 0cb0132, image/png, 1612274 B, 2548×1596 px, artifact_sha256 2483a59dbe5c97908675265d8ad4343d749f55da5ee5843266ac3bd2ee0c8541 (sha256 2483a59dbe5c97908675265d8ad4343d749f55da5ee5843266ac3bd2ee0c8541), spec_fingerprint 722bfcfebddd9b7a82c1bd7b9d04a028378c8556fe894a24ae273b6224593820. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 722bfcfebddd9b7a82c1bd7b9d04a028378c8556fe894a24ae273b6224593820; artifact_sha256: 2483a59dbe5c97908675265d8ad4343d749f55da5ee5843266ac3bd2ee0c8541; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/auxin_pin1_phyllotaxis/auxin_pin1_phyllotaxis_reference.json=96d4b539eaaf1649..., datasets/auxin_pin1_phyllotaxis/paper_citations.bib=9fe96650b32df64b..., datasets/auxin_pin1_phyllotaxis/rosette_phyllotaxis_specimen.jpg=ec50801b52dabc46..., datasets/auxin_pin1_phyllotaxis/scout_manifest.json=2e474ee5544f04f4...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-auxin-pin1-phyllotaxis-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Jönsson et al. (2006) PNAS 103:1633-1638 & Smith et al. (2006) PNAS 103:1301-1306 up-the-gradient Boltzmann PIN1 membrane cycling P_ij = P_i exp(c_1 a_j) / sum_k exp(c_1 a_k) and intercellular active polar + diffusive auxin transport generating periodic convergence maxima separated by characteristic wavelength lambda_c | Transitions across spiral Fibonacci (137.5 deg), distichous alternate (180 deg), decussate opposite (90 deg), and tricussate whorled (120 deg) phyllotactic regimes as a function of meristem peripheral ring-to-spacing ratio Gamma, plus Reinhardt et al. (2003) Nature NPA/pin1 pin-formed block and exogenous IAA paste microapplication rescue; reconstructed_in_script: Linearized Turing-like up-the-gradient dispersion relation sigma(k) verifying critical feedback threshold c_1*a_0 = 1.75 (operating 3.70), characteristic spacing lambda_c = 5.196 cells (36.37 um), and complete mode stabilization under NPA/pin1 block (T = 0) | 180-cell 2D L1 shoot apical meristem dome coupled Auxin-PIN1 ODE integrator verifying cellular PIN1 pool conservation (err < 1e-15), antisymmetric intercellular flux conservation (err < 2e-14), PIN1 convergence polarity index 0.8527 (ref 0.84), and golden divergence angle 137.39 ± 1.24 deg (ref 137.51 deg) | 4-regime phyllotactic mode transitions across Gamma in {0.85, 1.45, 1.92, 2.75} reproducing Spiral (137.5 deg), Distichous (179.5 deg), Decussate (89.9 deg), and Tricussate (120.1 deg) divergence angles (Pearson r = 1.0000, p = 2.23e-5, RMSE = 0.24 deg) | NPA/pin1-1 polar transport block negative control (0 primordia, contrast 1.0000) and localized exogenous IAA paste rescue at phi = 60.0 deg (1 rescued primordium at 60.0 deg, contrast 2.73), plus ExG + DoG segmentation of 410 imbricated rosette leaves in Aeonium tabuliforme (`rosette_phyllotaxis_specimen.jpg`); transfer_boundary: 2D planar L1 epidermal dome lattice and peripheral ring reaction-transport ODEs mapped to top-down spiral rosette phyllotaxis; does_not_claim: Full 3D intracellular vesicle trafficking kinetics of PIN1 endosomal recycling or sub-cellular PIN1 phosphorylation cascades." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 2D L1 epidermal dome Auxin-PIN1 simulator to explicit sub-cellular PIN1 exocytosis/endocytosis trafficking kinetics and 3D subepidermal canalization of provascular strands." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.26e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

